                    "cls": "dim"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "OPERATIONS & ENVIRONMENTAL SYSTEMS",
                    "cls": "dim"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "SYSTEMS COMMISSIONING NOTICE",
                    "cls": "dim"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "STARDATE 2093.072",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "TO: ALL DEPARTMENT HEADS, DSCF CHARON",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "FROM: VESSEL SYSTEMS INTEGRATION, MARS STATION",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Construction of the vessel is complete as of this date.",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "E.C.H.O.E.S. is commissioned as the single control hub",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "for the vessel's operations and environmental systems.",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "From one operating environment, E.C.H.O.E.S. governs",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "power distribution, atmosphere and water reclamation,",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "habitat drum rotation, thermal management, the",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "propulsion command interface, and the Operations Center",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "terminal network. No department may maintain a separate",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "controller for any of these.",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Systems checks begin today and run for eleven days.",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Departure is scheduled for 2093.083.",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Department heads will submit all system requests",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "through the Operations Center. Requests are to cite the",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "system by its full designation, E.C.H.O.E.S., or by",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ECH/OES on technical forms.",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Each message queue between the vessel and Mars Station",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "is assigned a reviewer at Mars Station. E.C.H.O.E.S.",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "queues outbound messages and presents each reviewer's",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "reply to the Operations Center.",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ISSUED UNDER THE AUTHORITY OF VESSEL SYSTEMS INTEGRATION.",
                    "cls": "low"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "[END OF NOTICE]",
                    "cls": "low"
                  }
                ],
                "children": [],
                "commands": []
              },
              {
                "id": "L1A_PRE_LAUNCH_SELF_CHECK",
                "type": "doc",
                "name": "PRE-LAUNCH SELF-CHECK",
                "alias": "[PRE-LAUNCH SELF-CHECK]",
                "tier": 1,
                "hidden": false,
                "title": "PRE-LAUNCH SELF-CHECK",
                "footer": "",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ECH/OES SELF-CHECK",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "FILE: ECH/OES/SELFCHECK/2093.082",
                    "cls": "dim"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "STARDATE 2093.082.2210",
                    "cls": "dim"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ECH/OES.POWER.DIST          NOMINAL",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ECH/OES.ATMOS.RECLAIM       NOMINAL",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ECH/OES.WATER.RECLAIM       NOMINAL",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ECH/OES.DRUM.ROTATION       NOMINAL    2.0 RPM",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ECH/OES.THERMAL             NOMINAL",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ECH/OES.PROPULSION.CMD      NOMINAL",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ECH/OES.OPS.NETWORK         NOMINAL",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ECH/OES.CORRESPONDENCE      QUEUE OPEN",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "                            REVIEWER: MARS STATION",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "RESULT: ALL CHECKS PASSED",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "DEPARTURE: 2093.083",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "NEXT SELF-CHECK: 2093.112",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "[END OF RECORD]",
                    "cls": "low"
                  }
                ],
                "children": [],
                "commands": []
              },
              {
                "id": "L1A_CREW_BULLETIN",
                "type": "doc",
                "name": "CREW BULLETIN",
                "alias": "[CREW BULLETIN]",
                "tier": 1,
                "hidden": false,
                "title": "CREW BULLETIN",
                "footer": "",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "OPERATIONS CENTER BULLETIN",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "STARDATE 2093.097",
                    "cls": "dim"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "TO: ALL CREW",
                    "cls": "dim"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "SUBJECT: SYSTEM DESIGNATION IN WORK ORDERS",
                    "cls": "dim"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Work orders that name the system \"Echoes\" are being",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "returned unprocessed.",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "E.C.H.O.E.S. is an initialism and is written with",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "periods on all forms. On technical forms, use ECH/OES.",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "A form that writes the name as a word will be returned",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "for correction.",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Operations Center acknowledges that the system is",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "called Echoes aloud, in the corridors and in the mess",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "hall. That use is tolerated in speech.",
                    "cls": "full"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "cls": "blank"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "[END OF BULLETIN]",
                    "cls": "low"
                  }
                ],
                "children": [],
                "commands": []
              }
            ],
            "commands": []
          },
